206:    Compute valid undirected edges between picked cells on a grid.
208:    Always includes cardinal distance-1 neighbors.  Optionally includes:
209:    - allow_skip: cardinal distance-2 when the intermediate cell is empty.
210:    - use_diagonal: diagonal distance-1 when both perpendicular cells are empty.
211:    """
